# CLAUDE.md - {BUSINESS NAME}

Copy this into the root of your working repo as `CLAUDE.md`, replace every
{PLACEHOLDER}, and delete sections that do not apply. This file is context an
agent reads every session, so keep it short, factual and current.

## Who we are

{BUSINESS NAME}, {civil / earthmoving / mining services / trade} contractor,
{CITY} {STATE}. We work mainly as a {subcontractor to head contractors /
subcontractor to mine operators / mixed}. Typical engagement is
{schedule of rates / lump sum / cost plus / wet hire / dry hire}.

